180
00:08:44,740 --> 00:08:46,500
So I break it down
into three kind

181
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:50,380
of things like chatbot plus,
background agent, and data

182
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:51,440
processor.

183
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:54,900
Chatbot plus is the one most
people are familiar with.

184
00:08:54,900 --> 00:08:58,700
It is basically two
of the killer apps

185
00:08:58,700 --> 00:09:01,000
