for language models.

186
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:04,200
ChatGPT and Claude code
fit in this archetype.

187
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,040
There is a human
on the other end.

188
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:10,700
They have human reaction
time, human latency tolerances

189
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:11,900
and interests.

190
00:09:11,900 --> 00:09:14,600
And I say chatbot plus
because it's not just yapping.

191
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:17,620
It's also that this thing
uses its text outputs

192
00:09:17,620 --> 00:09:21,540
