224
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,918
So it's going into file system.

225
00:10:50,918 --> 00:10:52,960
It's going into a database--
something like that.

226
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:58,100
So high volume, higher
latency tolerance, but often,

227
00:10:58,100 --> 00:11:00,760
as with many databases
and storage systems,

228
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:05,700
very bursty gaps between
periods of sparse writes

229
00:11:05,700 --> 00:11:08,300
